# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# The menu bar, audited and grown: every editor wears File, Edit AND
# Window -- so the other editor is reached from HERE, not through the
# project window; File carries the page's own Run and Stop with their
# keys; Cmd-S and Cmd-W are the keys their rows say; and Remove File
# takes a row out of the description while keeping every line the
# build does not know.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Development
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
click-window Project
wait 8
key Down
wait 8
key Return
wait 90
expect-title main.bas
note the second file, opened from the project as before
click-window Project
wait 8
key Down
key Down
wait 6
key Return
wait 90
expect-title util.bas
note the editor's OWN Window menu hops to the other editor: no detour
note through the project window, which every earlier script had to take
click 163 8
wait 8
expect-menu main.bas|util.bas|
menu-pick main.bas
wait 30
expect-title main.bas
note Cmd-S is the key its row says: a character, the key, the disk
key End
wait 3
key q
wait 4
key s ctrl
wait 60
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/main.bas a$q
note and back by the same menu, to close the second page by its key --
note Cmd-W takes the window it was pressed in, and only that one
click 163 8
wait 8
menu-pick util.bas
wait 30
expect-title util.bas
key w ctrl
wait 20
expect-no-title util.bas
click-window main.bas
wait 8
click 163 8
wait 8
expect-menu main.bas|
menu-pick main.bas
wait 10
note the page's File menu runs THIS file, and Stop stands beside it
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu Save main.bas|Run main.bas|Stop||Close main.bas|
menu-pick Run main.bas
wait 20
expect-pixel 274 270 b23434
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Stop
wait 30
expect-title Messages
note Remove File takes the SELECTED row out of the description -- and
note ONLY that: the line the build does not know rides through intact
click-window Project
wait 8
key Down
key Down
wait 6
click 132 8
wait 8
expect-menu New File…|Open File…|Add File…||Remove File|
menu-pick Remove File
wait 30
expect-file-lacks /tmp/trk_home/project.tiku file util.bas
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/project.tiku file main.bas
expect-file-has /tmp/trk_home/project.tiku board zebra
quit
